      </p>

      <h2>GMT to Lusaka Time</h2>
      <p>
        Lusaka, the capital of Zambia, also uses Central Africa Time (CAT, UTC+2). Like other CAT countries, Zambia does not observe daylight saving time. The conversion from GMT to Lusaka time is always <strong>GMT + 2 hours</strong>. Lusaka serves as a central business hub for the southern African region and hosts numerous international conferences and operations.
      </p>
